{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026fAmTVK2BsD1795154029.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>長沙灣一座工廈發生火警，一人不適送院。</p><p></p><p>網上片段見到大廈中層和天井冒出濃煙，大量黑色的濃煙升上半空。起火的是青山道嘉名工廠大廈，消防和警方事早上近10時半接報，消防到場架起雲梯灌救，工廈內60人自行疏散到地下。</p><p></p><p>初步調查相信，火警由雜物燃燒引起，一人不適送往明愛醫院治理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:44:07.593020+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T03:52:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T07:37:17.958005+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:21.234292+00:00","content_hash":"ff54d50c2bb7927dde2d725b8a1d84201a59b5bd158bdc24090bf1dba7724441","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:44:07.593020+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}